}

docs {
  Returns a zero-or-one-row array for the authenticated non-anonymous caller. Shared fields include the profile UUID, names, username, email, avatar_path, header_image_path, language_code, timestamps and profile_is_public. The extension object contains explicitly selected private product fields. Never use this response as a public profile projection. Anonymous access is denied; anonymous Auth users receive an empty array.
}
